+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value |
+| ------ | ----- |
+| Issue  | #37   |
+| Status | Draft |
+
+`ToolRegistry.execute` validates input against the resolved tool definition's `inputSchema` before invoking the executor. When input fails validation, it returns a `ToolResponse` describing the failure and does not invoke the executor ([validated by: rejects missing required input before invoking the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4)).
